      "content": "but i dont have insurance so going to a doctor is gonna cost me like $200 minimum. honestly the redness is kind of fading but it still feels weirdly scratchy. i really dont want to go to the clinic just for some soap. if i just use a couple drops of the antibiotic stuff to calm it down and prevent an infection, is that really gonna hurt me? it's better than nothing, right?",
